OL,3,GNEWSABlocked city drains 'making
OL,4,Aflooding worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in parts of Birmingham are
OL,7,Fbeing urged to report blocked street
OL,8,Fdrains amid concerns that heavy rain
OL,9,Fthis autumn could cause further
OL,10,Fflooding across the city.
OL,12,FLabour councillor Shuranjeet Singh said
OL,13,Frecent downpours had exposed
OL,14,Flongb@Qstanding problems with drainage
OL,15,Fin neighbourhoods including Handsworth
OL,16,Fand Winson Green.
OL,18,FThe West Midlands was hit by flash
OL,19,Fflooding last week, with residents in
OL,20,Fseveral areas of the city having to
OL,21,Funblock drains themselves to stop water
OL,22,Frising.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
