OL,3,GNEWSABlocked city drains 'making
OL,4,Aflooding worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham City Council said it was
OL,7,Freviewing concerns raised by residents
OL,8,Fand councillors as part of its wider
OL,9,Fassessment of recent flooding.
